DTSTART:20260814T170000
DTEND:20260814T200000
DTSTAMP:20260814T120301Z
UID:1abc4bdcece8f8dd75b1b0044a4e7c@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Starting June 26th join us for house-made wood-fired pizzas\, 
 live music\, and specialty summer cocktails every Friday from 5-9 p.m. Ord
 er them to go or grab a reservation and enjoy them out on the Clubhouse pa
 tio.<br/><br/><br/>Dead Men Strumming are an acoustic duo that cover the G
 rateful Dead's music in a thoughtful and authentic way.\n\nSources: Vermon
 t Public
